  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Memory package\n* Converted Immediate ``Select`` extension methods to extension blocks\n* Converted Immediate ``None`` extension methods to extension blocks\n* Added ``ReadOnlySpan<T>`` Numeric ``Sum``, ``Average``, ``Minimum``, and ``Maximum`` extensions\n* Added ``ReadOnlySpan<T>`` Immediate ``GroupBy`` and ``Where`` extensions\n* Added ``ReadOnlySpan<T>`` Immediate ``Any`` and ``All`` extensions\n* Added ``ReadOnySpan<T>`` Immediate ``Except`` extensions\n* Added ``ReadOnlySpan<T>`` Immediate ``CountAtMost`` non-predicate extension and converted predicate extensions to extension block\n* Added ``ReadOnlySpan<T>`` Immediate ``CountAtLeast`` predicate and non-predicate extensios in extension blocks\n* Fixed a xml doc comment grammar issue\n* Updated to DotExtensions 9.2.0 Preview 2 from 9.1.1\n* Addressed warnings caused by xml doc comments",
